您现在将自动注册参加锦标赛。

scripts.text:
{0}
The Magic Tournament is going to start soon.
Enter the portal to the south and you can join in.

scripts.translation:
{0}
魔法锦标赛即将开始。
进入南方的传送门即可加入。

scripts.text:
{0}
Thank you for visiting the Geffen Magic Tournament.
What can I do for you?

scripts.translation:
{0}
感谢您光临吉芬魔法大赛。
请问有什么可以帮您？

scripts.text:
{0}
This festival used to be a more studious event with scholars discussing magical methods.
Now it's all about fun and a big party.

scripts.translation:
{0}
这个节日过去更偏向学术性质，学者们会在此探讨魔法技法。
如今它已变成了一场充满乐趣的大型庆典。

scripts.text:
{0}
Now it has become almost exclusively a fighting tournament.
The most famous Mages from all over the world come for the tournament.

scripts.translation:
{0}
现在它几乎完全变成了一场格斗锦标赛。
来自世界各地的著名魔法师都会来参加比赛。

scripts.text:
{0}
There is no registration fee to enter.
The only requirement is to pass a simple test.

scripts.translation:
{0}
参赛没有报名费。
唯一的要求是通过一个简单的测试。

scripts.text:
{0}
If you fail you will automatically be eliminated from the list but you can try again as many times as you wish.
Do you want to take the test?

scripts.translation:
{0}
如果您测试失败，将自动从名单中淘汰，但您可以无限次重试。
您想参加测试吗？

scripts.text:
{0}
You can participate in the Magic Tournament after passing the test.
Then, let us begin!

scripts.translation:
{0}
通过测试后，您可以参加魔法锦标赛。
那么，让我们开始吧！

{0}
女士们，先生们！
欢迎来到吉芬魔法大赛！

scripts.text:
{0}
I am honored to be this year's MC.
Now, it's time for the matches to begin.

scripts.translation:
{0}
很荣幸能担任今年的主持人。
现在，比赛即将开始。

scripts.text:
{0}
You won the competition!
Congratulations!

scripts.translation:
{0}
您赢得了比赛！
恭喜！

scripts.text:
{0}
By the way, the Academy Master has
something to tell you!

scripts.translation:
{0}
恭喜！
这是该赛事历史上最强大的一届参赛者阵容。

scripts.text:
